        <mxCell id="c2" value="Bank &quot;Standart&quot;: roadmap of online deposit opening. MVP in 6 months, target solution in 12 months" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="15" width="2610" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3" value="Rows are the systems from the ADRs (Task3 and Task4) and the teams that change them. Blue: MVP scope from Task3. Orange: the new case from Task4 (rates for the bank and partner call centers). Purple: target solution, months 7–12. Grey: business activities. Diamonds are milestones, arrows are the key dependencies." style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="2610" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
